[{"client_msg_id":"9f5d2f6c-480f-4924-8d2b-b5eaf72de683","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"関数の引数にはできるんですね!それがやりたいです。\nちょっと今日は無理なので明日設計をもう一度きちんとやって、できればDiscordで作業配信しようかな","ts":"1628333272.203900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FAn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8184b13-3c81-46ef-8ded-cb9f9aa8a124","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Context使えばCustom Hooksでも参照できるとかはあるけど、どういうケースなのか分かってない","ts":"1628333030.202300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pjBh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9559d09-9ec6-443e-8072-e8361d121996","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"関数の引数とかにするのはできるけど、Hooksをグローバル変数として参照するのは仕組み的に不可能が解答でいいのかな","ts":"1628332977.201200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HpVD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d72b85b-5797-44ba-9a2e-3778edea95ff","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"グローバルに参照したい？","ts":"1628332942.200400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c5q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d15a3cd1-6d16-4879-aadf-2d4a7ae11634","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"コンポーネントではないですね。","ts":"1628332929.199800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nsxe/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"040c1963-04d1-4fc9-91e1-4e6cabd7b980","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"別ファイルっていうのが別コンポーネントって意味であればpropsとして渡せば参照できます","ts":"1628332900.199100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"42b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1dccb2d1-caaf-487a-b3b9-9558ae85b2be","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"useStateで設定した値って別ファイルから参照できますかね?","ts":"1628332854.198100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zfU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b239bd67-d54a-4d14-b7fd-e644838b6b5d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど…なんか設計が甘い気がしてきた","ts":"1628332826.197500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qFKM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a46fb71-88f3-4549-86e8-3196b4569043","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分今言ってるのはonChangeのところをonSubmitにするとかじゃないかなって思ってて、そこは好きに書いていいかと思います","ts":"1628332790.196900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JKM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d747036-4d52-4bb0-8012-529e56e1b357","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1628332757.196000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/+I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a6c1d77-219a-46ab-a3ab-5b0cf5aeb2eb","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"はい。型安全な書きかたは参考にさせてもらいます!","ts":"1628332751.195800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mSOY/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59f26689-6f73-4ee1-b8fc-e45c46a08786","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そこは元の記述からいじってなくて、今書いたのはtimeを型安全に取り回すための書き方ですね","ts":"1628332696.195200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wHuU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d98a8f4-a01c-4e1b-b9ac-0c7f01e97765","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど、ただonChangeにすると例えば `60`と入力しようとしても `6`で更新されて `0`に上書きみたいになったり、別ファイルで値を参照したいので今回は普通に値を取得する方向でいこうとおもいます","ts":"1628332635.194200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pJht"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f323f25-b350-46e3-b6df-1433664c4f16","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U01AQ5BFNLX\u003e","ts":"1628332526.192200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"twJke"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d86ce042-4b2e-4dc9-90be-53d9266ec3fd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分これで型安全だと思うんだけど","ts":"1628332524.192000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DSi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8db6259b-e630-46d9-b0de-5332ce40daa1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```type TimeKey = 'focusMin' | 'focusSec' | 'breakMin' | 'breakSec';\n\ntype InputProps = {\n  type: string;\n  name: TimeKey;\n  value: string;\n};\n\ntype Time = { [key in TimeKey]: string };\n\nconst isTimeKey = (key: string): key is TimeKey =\u0026gt; {\n  if (key !== 'focusMin' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; key !== 'focusSec' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; key !== 'breakMin' \u0026amp;\u0026amp; key !== 'breakSec') {\n    return false;\n  }\n  return true;\n};\n\nexport const Input: FC\u0026lt;InputProps\u0026gt; = ({ type, name, value }) =\u0026gt; {\n  const [time, setTime] = useState\u0026lt;Time\u0026gt;({\n    focusMin: '0',\n    focusSec: '0',\n    breakMin: '0',\n    breakSec: '0',\n  });\n\n  const handleChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent\u0026lt;HTMLInputElement\u0026gt;) =\u0026gt; {\n    const key = e.target.name;\n    if (!isTimeKey(key)) {\n      throw new Error();\n    }\n\n    setTime({ ...time, [key]: e.target.value });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    \u0026lt;label\u0026gt;\n      \u0026lt;input type={type} value={value} name={name} onChange={handleChange} /\u0026gt;\n    \u0026lt;/label\u0026gt;\n  );\n};```","ts":"1628332484.191700","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1628332594.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XbSc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffaba2ba-87a8-4532-af95-10f3436676d3","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"バイナリ・・・？","ts":"1628332475.191300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DBvb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"379e59cc-6ab