":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZjM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b628391-dac6-4777-acb1-f85d96c51c30","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"というと?","ts":"1628331551.189000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nMHAy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d805962f-95cc-4dd1-9fbc-65a33b02d83e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分はこれでもそんな困らないと思うんですけど、記法そんなに冗長です？","ts":"1628331543.188800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Md6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1a8d775-871c-4c93-b810-9e638cd93c3e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"これどうするのが正解なんだろ…","ts":"1628331502.188000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ipT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9efc35d-a055-480e-ab48-1125ef6e7df1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"stateのkeyにユニオン型でちゃんと型を付けるとstringでもエラー吐きますね","ts":"1628331485.187600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PcZ//"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64cc93ba-c875-44ba-ad77-7295d1d89560","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そもそもanyなのかこれ・・・","ts":"1628331444.186700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hTlfH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0d68d76-eec7-4b60-b763-96446fd94b57","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"そうなんですよね。 `Element implicitly has an 'any' type because expression of type 'string' can't be used to index type` がでる","ts":"1628331428.186400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6+Zr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75ddcc0c-ed23-4507-b947-fb6a9488f6d9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"確かにこれだとこう書いた方がいいかも\nちゃんと型付けたときにasでcastしないとエラー出ちゃう気がするけど","ts":"1628331356.185600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fvyP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40bc9431-4f97-4cda-bdf5-acf021db19f3","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"inputのvalueを `time.props.name`みたいにしたいです","ts":"1628331118.183500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EQmwR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f74bba46-bf1b-443a-9024-3160cde51786","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"いまは、こんな風になってます","ts":"1628331094.182900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Ec5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"620d3162-08bb-4fa3-8209-c9686e853fe4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"```export default function input(props:InputProps){\nconst [time,setTime] = useState({\n  focus_min: \"0\",\n  focus_sec: \"0\",\n  break_min: \"0\",\n  break_sec: \"0\"\n});\n\nconst handleChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent\u0026lt;HTMLInputElement\u0026gt;) =\u0026gt; {\n    setTime({...time, [e.target.name]: e.target.value});\n}\n\nreturn (\n    \u0026lt;label\u0026gt;\n      {props.lavelname}\n      \u0026lt;input type={props.type} value={time} name={props.name} onChange={handleChange}/\u0026gt;\n    \u0026lt;/label\u0026gt;\n)\n}```","ts":"1628331082.182500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u5M4b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5290fcde-9b9b-48e0-8b54-9f715fc85390","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"変数化、たまに必要なこともあるんですけど結構使います？","ts":"1628331075.182300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UfprV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0d71c0e-ae1a-47bd-b56c-8b2018945f59","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"そのbarの部分を変数化したいんですけど、それができないのでブラケットを使ってました","ts":"1628331039.181500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M9jL"}]},{"cli